@startuml
title US13 - List Employees by Role\nSystem Sequence Diagram (SSD)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #334155
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9E6

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UKLabsMS" as System

== Request Employee List ==

Admin -> System : requestEmployeesByRole()
activate System

System --> Admin : requestRole()

Admin -> System : submitRole(role)

alt Valid role and matching employees exist
    System --> Admin : displayEmployees(employeeList, totalCount)
else Valid role but no employees found
    System --> Admin : displayNoEmployeesFound()
else Empty role
    System --> Admin : displayInvalidRoleError()
end

deactivate System

note right of System
US13 - List Employees by Role

The Administrator selects a role.

The system returns all employees
matching the selected role.

The operation is read-only.

Exact role matching is currently
case-sensitive.
end note

@enduml